And we thank you, I embrace you.

335
00:26:13,000 --> 00:26:18,000
Saeta te xweş kekê Xelîl, hatina te jî hatineke pir
giranbuha bû.
 
May your time be good brother Xelil, your coming too was a
very valuable coming.

336
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:21,000
Xwedê te jî razî be. O hatinek wisa... wisa xweş...
 
May God be pleased with you too. And a coming like that...
so nice...

337
00:26:21,000 --> 00:26:27,000
Dankê dayikê, çend car xweş e...
 
Mother's bulgur, how many times good...

338
00:26:27,000 --> 00:26:33,000
Silavên min ji xaltiya min ra hene, ji mamê min ra hene...
 
My greetings are to my aunt, to my uncle...

339
00:26:33,000 --> 00:26:40,000
Ji keçmeta min ra hene, ji jinmamê min ra hene, ji cîranan
re hene...
 
Are to my cousin, to my aunt-in-law, to the neighbors...

340
00:26:40,000 --> 00:26:45,000
Em hêvîdar in rojên xweş dîsa em bi hev ra derbas bikin...
 
We hope we spend the good days together again...

341
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:50,000
...dîsa weke berê... em li gund bin.
 
...again like before... we are in the village.

342
00:26:50,000 --> 00:26:58,000
Ez daxwaz dikim ji miletê me, Xelîl bişopînin, ew rûmet e.
 
I request from our nation, follow Xelil, he is an honor.

343
00:26:58,000 --> 00:27:03,000
Gelek nas dikin... tiştên kevn derdixe.
 
Many know... he brings out the old things.

344
00:27:03,000 --> 00:27:05,000
Û saetên we xweş bin.
 
And may your hours be good.

345
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:10,000
Bi rastî spasiyeke mezin ji te ra dikim, her kesê vî mafî
dide te... saeta te xweş.
 
Really I thank you very much, everyone who gives you this
right... your time is good.

346
00:27:10,000 --> 00:27:16,000
Ez hêvîdar im em wekî xwe alîkariya te bikin...
 
I hope we assist you as ourselves...

347
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:22,000
Bi rastî ez vîdyoyên te dibînim, tu gundan bi hev ra derbas
dikî... tu nav gundan ra diçî...
 
Really I see your videos, you pass the villages together...
you go through the villages...

348
00:27:22,000 --> 00:27:33,000
Bes tiştek... qalîteya berê te zêde kir... ya deng... me
gişî dît...
 
But one thing... you increased the previous quality... of
the voice... we all saw...

349
00:27:33,000 --> 00:27:44,000
Em gihîştin wê qenatê ku ev qanal, em wê bişopînin.
 
We reached the conclusion that this channel, we should
follow it.

350
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:48,000
Îşelleh vîdyoyên din ez ê bêtir baş amade bibim.
 
God willing the other videos I will be better prepared.

351
00:27:48,000 --> 00:27:52,000
Di vîdyoyên din da em ê derbasî cem xaltîka min bibin. Û
silavek li mamê xwe dikim...
 
In the other videos we will pass by my aunt. And I send a
greeting to my uncle...

352
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:57,000
Ez hêvîdar im vîdyoyên din derbasî derên din bibin. Xwedê te
jî kêfxweş bike.
 
I hope the other videos pass to other places. May God make
you happy too.

353
00:27:57,000 --> 00:28:00,000
Û birayê te heye...
 
And you have a brother...

354
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:04,000
Birayê min çawa ye?
 
How is my brother?

355
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:10,000
Birayê min Ehmed ji nav gundan... silavên me jibo wî hene.
 
My brother Ehmed from the villages... our greetings for him.

356
00:28:10,000 --> 00:28:18,000
Û ez pir kêfxweş im bi van vîdyoyên te...
 
And I am very happy with these videos of yours...

357
00:28:18,000 --> 00:28:30,000
Saeta te xweş... bi rastî tiştekî pir xweş e... tu mirovên
di xerbê de navê wan tînî, em pê serbilind in.
 
May your time be good... really it is a very nice thing...
you bring the names of people in exile, we are proud of it.

358
00:28:30,000 --> 00:28:36,000
Û ev tiştek e tu bêtir min kêfxweş dikî.
 
And this is a thing you make me happier.

359
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:40,000
Em wek hev in...
 
We are like each other...

360
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:48,000
Silavên min ji braderên min Ehmed ra hene... me gelek wextên
xweş bi hevdû ra derbas kirin...
 
My greetings to my brothers Ehmed... we spent many good
times with each other...

361
00:28:48,000 --> 00:28:52,000
Înşalla vîdyoyên we dîsa derkevin, saet xweş.
 
God willing your videos come out again, good hour.

362
00:28:52,000 --> 00:29:00,000
Spasiyên min bo te jî... em gelek kêfxweş bûn bi hatina te.
 
My thanks to you too... we were very happy with your coming.

363
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:05,000
Saet xweş... Xwedê xêra te binivîse, Xwedê bi te razî be...
 
Good hour... may God write your reward, may God be pleased
with you...

